      "content": "If you are feeling like the world has no place for you, it's incredibly important to know that you are not alone in this feeling of being invisible. The pain you're describing is immense, and when everything feels pointless, reaching out for immediate support is crucial. Please consider contacting a crisis hotline or mental health professional right now; they are trained to help you navigate these overwhelming feelings. You deserve support during this incredibly dark time.",
